  "description": "CR 111.1, 111.4, 608.2c, 611.2c, 702.111b, 702.15b, 702.10b, 302.6, 514.2: Midnight Mayhem creates three 1/1 red Gremlin tokens, then the Gremlins its caster controls gain menace, lifelink and haste until end of turn",
